#: assets/anduinos-oobe:446
msgid "Welcome Home."
msgstr "Dobro došli kući."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:456
msgid "AnduinOS is ready. Just a few steps to shape it"
msgstr "AnduinOS je spreman. Još samo nekoliko koraka"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:456
msgid "into the perfect system tailored to your habits."
msgstr "do sustava prilagođenog vašim navikama."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:466
msgid "  Start Setup  "
msgstr "  Pokreni postavljanje  "

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:513
msgid "Connect to the Internet"
msgstr "Povežite se s internetom"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:521
msgid ""
"Connect now so AnduinOS can safely check for updates, drivers, and apps."
msgstr ""
"Povežite se sada kako bi AnduinOS mogao sigurno provjeriti ažuriranja, "
"upravljačke programe i aplikacije."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:529
msgid "Internet Connection"
msgstr "Internetska veza"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:536
