#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2120
msgid "Your Data. Your Rules. Period."
msgstr "Vaši podaci. Vaša pravila."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2129
msgid ""
"AnduinOS does not send usage statistics or diagnostic reports to any "
"organization by default."
msgstr ""
"AnduinOS prema zadanim postavkama ne šalje statistiku korištenja ni "
"dijagnostička izvješća nijednoj organizaciji."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2129
msgid "We do not collect your usage habits."
msgstr "Ne prikupljamo vaše navike korištenja."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2130
msgid "We do not upload your search history."
msgstr "Ne prenosimo vašu povijest pretraživanja."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2130
msgid "There are no pervasive advertisements."
msgstr "Nema nametljivih oglasa."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2141
msgid ""
"In an era ruled by algorithms and surveillance, this is our firmest "
"commitment to you."
msgstr "U doba algoritama i nadzora ovo je naše čvrsto obećanje."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2159
msgid ""
"✓ Zero telemetry — the operating system itself never reports your activity"
msgstr ""
"✓ Bez telemetrije — sam operacijski sustav nikada ne izvještava o vašim "
"aktivnostima"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2160
msgid ""
"✓ No mandatory internet connection — the operating system does not contact "
"AIURSOFT servers except for updates"
msgstr ""
"✓ Internetska veza nije obavezna — operacijski sustav ne kontaktira "
"poslužitelje AIURSOFT-a osim radi ažuriranja"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2161
msgid "✓ No ads in your operating system"
msgstr "✓ Bez oglasa u operacijskom sustavu"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2162
msgid "✓ Full root access — you truly own your machine"
msgstr "✓ Potpun administratorski pristup — vi upravljate svojim računalom"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2163
msgid "✓ UFW firewall — your digital perimeter, defended"
msgstr "✓ Vatrozid UFW — zaštita vašeg digitalnog okruženja"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2164
msgid "✓ Open source — the code is yours to inspect and modify"
msgstr "✓ Otvoreni kod — možete ga pregledavati i mijenjati"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2205
msgid "Welcome to the AnduinOS Community"
msgstr "Dobro došli u zajednicu AnduinOS-a"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2214
msgid ""
"Whether you're a Windows refugee seeking shelter, or a hardcore geek "
"developer — you'll find your tribe here."
msgstr ""
"Bez obzira na to dolazite li iz sustava Windows ili ste iskusni zaljubljenik "
"u programiranje, ovdje ćete pronaći svoju zajednicu."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2215
msgid "Found a bug? Want a feature? Tell us anytime."
msgstr "Pronašli ste grešku ili želite novu značajku? Javite nam."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2227
msgid "Official Documentation"
msgstr "Službena dokumentacija"

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2228
